    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Bandipur National Park was among the first nine reserves chosen for Project Tiger launched in 1973.",
        "Bannerghatta National Park features India's first dedicated Butterfly Park, established in 2006.",
        "Sandalwood (Santalum album) is central to Karnataka's forestry economics and earned the state its reputation as the 'Land of Sandalwood'."
      ],
      "id": "l7kpx4t"
